      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长在窗边看着光景微笑着。\n她的表情看起来没有一丝的寂寞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc2bffa7088f063a6c8514857502b7ec30a83ef0484c7e724edd9fa0e5ee1c9e",
