      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "做完工作后，我和秋川理事长\n去了弗隆塔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26a940305239bb5f0944d139c359974eac9e36a01052099befece1658461ce4a",
